1
00:00:08,759 --> 00:00:10,240
hello my name is
你好，我的名字是

2
00:00:10,240 --> 00:00:11,439
William today
威廉今天

3
00:00:11,439 --> 00:00:14,619
I am visiting the fire station to see the firefighters
我正在参观消防局看消防员

4
00:00:27,160 --> 00:00:34,380
firefighters work every day morning and night they eat and rest at the fire station
消防员每天早晚工作他们在消防站吃饭和休息

5
00:00:35,920 --> 00:00:42,380
firefighters work very hard when there's an emergency they go and help people
消防员在紧急情况下非常努力地工作，他们去帮助人们

6
00:00:45,439 --> 00:00:58,179
hello William hello the firefighters wear uniforms look they wear helmets big jackets gloves trousers and boots
你好，威廉，你好，消防员穿着制服，看起来他们戴着头盔，大夹克，手套，裤子和靴子

7
00:01:00,039 --> 00:01:04,120
when the firefighters go to a fire they need to wear special masks
当消防员去救火时，他们需要戴上特殊的面具

8
00:01:04,120 --> 00:01:08,040
I'm going to try it on okay William let's put this on
我要试穿一下，好吧，威廉，让我们穿上这个。

9
00:01:27,239 --> 00:01:35,879
this is the fire engine the fire engine is big and red it's got ladders and hoses for water the firefighters stop fires
这是消防车，消防车又大又红，有梯子和水管，消防员可以灭火。

10
00:01:35,879 --> 00:01:36,680
with these
用这些

11
00:01:41,799 --> 00:01:47,780
down by your feet in front of your left foot is a silver switch and that turns the sirens on
在你的左脚前面有一个银色的开关，它可以打开警报器。

12
00:01:49,879 --> 00:01:52,379
behind it is a red switch which turns the bullhorn on
它后面是一个红色开关，可以打开扩音器

13
00:01:54,879 --> 00:01:57,359
which makes quite a loud noise and makes people jump
这会发出很大的噪音，让人跳起来

14
00:01:58,760 --> 00:02:07,500
when there's a fire the firefighters need lots of water to stop the fire they use a hose to get the water to the fire
发生火灾时，消防员需要大量的水来灭火，他们用软管将水输送到火中。

15
00:02:07,519 --> 00:02:09,740
the hose is very heavy
软管很重

16
00:02:14,599 --> 00:02:18,860
firefighters practice in a special house at the fire station
消防员在消防局的一个特殊的房子里练习

17
00:02:39,840 --> 00:02:46,620
firefighters have a dangerous job they're very brave and we're very lucky that they are here to help us
消防员有一份危险的工作，他们非常勇敢，我们很幸运他们在这里帮助我们

